# CRS files that are mostly TX/anomaly/ctl machinery (little or no MainRule output)
#
# REQUEST-900-*: exclusion templates (wl:… in NAXSI BasicRule)
# REQUEST-901-INITIALIZATION: sets TX vars / CRS setup — use naxsi LearningMode / CheckRule
# REQUEST-905 / REQUEST-999: exception/skip machinery — map manually to BasicRule wl:<id>
# REQUEST-949 / RESPONSE-959: anomaly score blocking — see checkrules.conf
# RESPONSE-980-CORRELATION: logging/correlation only — no NAXSI equivalent
#
# Response leak files (950–956) ARE converted: signatures adapted onto request MZs.
